; S021 ORB -- FundingPips 2-Step Standard $10K, MASTER account (MT5), US summer time (Mar-Nov).
; Firm limits: daily 5% (vs day-start balance/equity, reset 00:00 platform time), max 10% static.
; Our guard is tighter: 4.5% / 9%. Server rule assumed TZ_EET_US_DST -- the EA verifies it live
; (init event: server_offset_expected_s == server_offset_observed_s).
; Master auto-closes positions 20:45-21:00 UTC in summer -> exit at 20:44 UTC (winter: leave empty).
; InpRiskPct: placeholder 0.5 -- set the risk chosen for this account before attaching.
; Enum codes: ServerTzRule/DayResetRule 0=UTC 1=FIXED 2=EET_US_DST 3=EET_EU_DST 4=CET_EU_DST
InpRiskPct=0.5
InpDailyRiskCapPct=0.0
InpMaxRealRiskWarnPct=4.5
InpInitialBalance=10000.0
InpDailyGuardPct=4.5
InpMaxGuardPct=9.0
InpDayResetRule=2
InpDayResetFixedHours=0
InpServerTzRule=2
InpServerFixedHours=0
InpVerifyServerOffset=true
InpExitBufferMin=0
InpForceExitUtc=20:44
InpDoubleFillPolicy=0
InpMagic=21021
InpHistoryDays=45
InpLogToCommon=true
InpWriteDaysCsv=true
InpTimerSeconds=1
